{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120319001:0":{"text":"ゲホッ、ゲホッ……ソーンお兄ちゃんとメイジ様……おかえり！","source_cn":"咳，咳咳……索恩哥哥，还有魔法师大人……你们回来啦！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x944A830456D3EFCD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ゲホッ、ゲホッ……ソーンお兄ちゃんとメイジ様……おかえり！","female":"ゲホッ、ゲホッ……ソーンお兄ちゃんとメイジ様……おかえり！","variant_male_record_index":"123140","variant_female_record_index":"123141","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120319002:0":{"text":"あれっ、なんで……変なミーアキャットまでいるの？","source_cn":"诶，怎么还多了一只……奇怪的狐獴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBB07E581D06E5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120319003:1":{"text":"ババリアはん、ワイは変なミーアキャットやあらへん。アンタを治すためにわざわざ来てやった天才薬剤師のアクンや。","source_cn":"小蛮血，我可不是什么奇怪的狐獴。我是专门来帮你的天才药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A9C28C0D862AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120319004:0":{"text":"薬剤師……？","source_cn":"药剂师……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB92F779FBFFA824D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120319005:1":{"text":"本当だよ。僕たちで薬を作ったから、早く飲んでみて。","source_cn":"他说的没错。我们弄到药了，你快把这个喝下去试试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A347621D70A923C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120319006:0":{"text":"うぅ……やな臭いがする……","source_cn":"呜……这个味道好难闻……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC91FB677A3647E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120319007:1":{"text":"大丈夫、僕を信じて。これを飲めば元気になれるから！","source_cn":"乖，相信我，只要喝下这个，你就能好起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5212A0ABAAAEDBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120319008:0":{"text":"ゲホッ……分かった！アルサお姉ちゃんを信じるよ……うぅ……","source_cn":"咳……好！我听阿尔萨姐姐的话……唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD35AAF73A8D755B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120319009:0":{"text":"このお薬……すっごくまずいや。この前飲んだお薬よりまずいし、変な味がするよ……","source_cn":"这个药剂……好难喝，比之前的还要难喝，有种怪怪的味道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA505F53DE79D8139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120319010:0":{"text":"気分はどう？どこか具合の悪いところは？","source_cn":"你现在感觉怎么样？有哪里不舒服吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5296867192FFBF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_tit